  "prefLabel": "Spe 301.03 Certificate of Clinical Competence (CCC)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Spe 301.03 \"Certificate of Clinical Competence (CCC)\" means the professional credential issued by the Council for Clinical Certification of ASHA on the basis of successful completion of specified academic requirements, specified practicum requirements, an examination and specified post-graduate professional experience.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Spe 300) #9125, eff 4-5-08; ss by #10906, eff 8-7-15",
